            {
                "entry_id": "e3a1bb47-6acb-3e6b-bd67-5db11bf8abcc",
                "word": "Uber",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cca31650-e74a-4f5e-a4bf-2afe5eac5740",
                        "entry_id": "e3a1bb47-6acb-3e6b-bd67-5db11bf8abcc",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Ubers"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e8831aa5-82f9-3aaf-a114-0c1f84abbc8e",
                        "entry_id": "e3a1bb47-6acb-3e6b-bd67-5db11bf8abcc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A car ride requested using the mobile application Uber; the vehicle used for the ride."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c23b60d-3298-4fc2-b13f-903abd7563df",
                                "sense_id": "e8831aa5-82f9-3aaf-a114-0c1f84abbc8e",
                                "text": "Simply because there are more drivers who have signed up to partner with Uber than there are yellow taxis does not mean that there are more Ubers on the road."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a8156fc-85fa-4846-9de9-9b08b3f86293",
                                "sense_id": "e8831aa5-82f9-3aaf-a114-0c1f84abbc8e",
                                "text": "It all comes back to two highly compelling moments. The moment you requested an Uber and the moment you exited the car with a mere thank-you."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a539905e-9ab8-4b8c-91fc-7ebe7c46f043",
                                "sense_id": "e8831aa5-82f9-3aaf-a114-0c1f84abbc8e",
                                "text": "Last week, my cousin asked me how to schedule an Uber for a morning ride to the airport. Because I drive Uber almost every night (and write stories about it), she was quite surprised that I had no idea how to do it."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9bc9e6f0-7858-382a-9bbc-1dda7c454c67",
                        "entry_id": "e3a1bb47-6acb-3e6b-bd67-5db11bf8abcc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One's passenger or driver on Uber."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
